hungerpoints.licence.text35=§lChanges and Additions:
hungerpoints.licence.text36= A warning icon now appears in the item name of foods that give negative effects! This feature is available in both the "Detailed Item Names" and "Hunger & Saturation Points Only" mode.
hungerpoints.licence.text37= Added a new "Add-on Cross-compatibility" section in the Item Info+ screen in the game settings.
hungerpoints.licence.text38= Added support for the "5" music disc.
hungerpoints.licence.text39= Added support for the Swift Sneak enchantment.
hungerpoints.licence.text40= Added support for the Ender Dragon and Wither Spawn Eggs, alongside a new icon for Bosses in their spawn eggs' item names.
hungerpoints.licence.text41= Added support for the Allay and Warden Spawn Eggs.
hungerpoints.licence.text42= Added support for the Camel Spawn Egg.
hungerpoints.licence.text42_1= Added support for the Snow Golem and Iron Golem Spawn Eggs.
hungerpoints.licence.text42_2= Added support for new items from the Beyond The Underground add-on.
hungerpoints.licence.text42_3= 

hungerpoints.licence.text42_4= 	#
