hungerpoints.licence.text44=§lBug Fixes:
hungerpoints.licence.text44_1= The settings screen now works correctly in versions 1.19.40 and above.
hungerpoints.licence.text44_2= There is no longer an extra space in the item name of Raw Chickens.
hungerpoints.licence.text44_3= There is no longer an extra space in the item name of Apples in Finnish.
hungerpoints.licence.text44_4= There is no longer an extra space in the item name of the Agent Spawn Egg in Traditional Chinese.
